          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መምህሪቱ፡ ከእግዚአብሔር፡ የተማረች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትምህርቲቱ፡ ከእግዚአብሔር፡ የተገኘች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ፡ ሆነች ፡ መርምሯት ፡ እንጅ ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ መምህርን ፡ ትምህርትን ፡ አት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መኑ ፡ ትምህርቱ ፡ መምህሩ ፡ ከእግዚአብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሔር ፡ የተማረ ፡ የተገኘ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መርምሩ ፡ እንጅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ብዙኃን ፡ ሐሳውያነ ፡ ነቢያት ፡ መጽኡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውስተ ፡ ዓለም ፡ እለ ፡ ኢየአምኑ ፡ በኢየሱስ ፡ ክር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስቶስ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስን ፡ የማያውቁ ፡ ነቢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያትን ፡ የሚያሳብሉ ፡ በነቢያት ፡ የሚያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሉ ፡ ብዙ ፡ ሐሰተኞች ፡ መምህራን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዚህ ፡ ዓለም ፡ ተነሥተዋልና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ፤ ⟪ወበዝንቱ ፡ ተአምርዋ ፡ ለመንፈሰ ፡ እግዚአብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሔር ፡ ወለመንፈሰ ፡ ሐሰት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዚህም ፡ ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የተማረች",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውን ፡ መምህርና ፡ ከሰይጣን ፡ የተማረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ችውን ፡ መምህር ። አንድም ፡ ከእግዚአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሔር ፡ የተገኘችውን ፡ ትምህርትና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሰይጣን ፡ የተገኘችውን ፡ ትምህርት ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ እውነተኛይቱን ፡ ትምህርትና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐሰተኛይቱን ፡ ትምህርት ፡ እውነተኛይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቱን ፡ መምህርና ፡ ሐሰተኛይቱን ፡ መምህ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ር ፡ ታውቋታላችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ኵላ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ እንተ ፡ ተአምን ፡ ከመ ፡ ኢየሱስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክርስቶስ ፡ መጽአ ፡ በሥጋ ፡ ሰብእ ፡ እምነ ፡ እግዚአብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሔር ፡ ይእቲ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡ በሥጋ ፡ ሰው ፡ ሆኖ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ፡ መጣ ፡ የምታምን ፡ መምህር ፡ የም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታሳምን ፡ ትምህርት ፡ መምህሪቱ ፡ ከእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግዚአብሔር ፡ የተማረች ፡ ትምህርቲቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የተገኘች ፡ ናት ፡ ፩ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቆሮ ፡ ፲፪ ፡ ፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": "፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፫ ፤ ⟪ወኵላ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ እንተ ፡ ኢተአምን ፡ በኢየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡ ከመ ፡ መጽአ ፡ በሥጋ ፡ ሰብእ ፡ ኢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኮነት ፡ እምነ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡ በሥጋ፡ እንደ ፡ መጣ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰው ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ የማያምን ፡ መምህር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የማያሳምን ፡ ትምህርት ፡ ግን ፡ መምህሩ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የተማረ ፡ ትምህርቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የተገኘ ፡ አይደለም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዝንቱ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ሐሳዌ ፡ መሢሕ ፡ ዘሰማዕክሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመ ፡ ይመጽእ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲነሣ ፡ የሰማችሁት ፡ መሢሕ ፡ ክር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስቶስን ፡ የሚያሳብል ። አንድም ፡ በመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሢሕ ፡ በክርስቶስ፡ የሚያብል ። አንድም፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐሳዌ ፡ መሢሕ ፡ ይላል ፡ ሐሰተኛ ፡ መ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምህር ፡ ይህ ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይእዜኒ ፡ ወድአ ፡ መጽአ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኋላ ፡ ከሁሉ ፡ ደርሶ ፡ እንዲገለጽ ፡ ተገ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልጾ ፡ ከሁሉ፡ እንዲደርስ ፡ ዛሬም፡ ፈጽሞ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተገልጾአል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወውስተ ፡ ዓለም ፡ ሀሎ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሁሉ ፡ ደርሷል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": "፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፬ ፤ ⟪ወአንትሙሰ ፡ እምነ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትሙ ፡ ደቂቅየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልጆቼ ፡ እናንተስ ፡ ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወለዳችሁ ፡ የተማራችሁ ፡ ናችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሞእክምዎ ፡ ለእኩይ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኩይ ፡ ፈቃደ ፡ ሥጋን ። አንድም፡ እኩይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈቃደ ፡ ሰይጣንን ፡ ድል ፡ ነሥታችኋልና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ የዐቢ ፡ ዘሀሎ ፡ ምስሌክሙ ፡ እምነ ፡ ዘው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስተ ፡ ዓለም ፡ ሀሎ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዓለሙ ፡ አድሮ ፡ ካለ ፡ ሀብተ ፡ ሰይጣን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
